The protocol and receiver preserve native Cartographer probability-grid values
and coordinate semantics. Upstream Cartographer and Cartographer ROS are
Copyright The Cartographer Authors, Apache-2.0. The Cartographer ROS reference
pin is 743345256b43a7fd95765d40c7332b6f31ab66bb. The reference core pin
1489fc9 is not asserted equal to the separately installed apt core.

The strict JavaScript receiver, display geometry and Python/standalone byte
helpers are included with their exact source checksums in SOURCE.json. This
package does not redistribute upstream C++ runtime code or compiled binaries.
Synthetic fixtures are test inputs, not recorded sensor data.
